<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA BEAT LONDON COUNTIES 63-20.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA BEAT LONDON COUNTIES 63-20.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat London Counties 63-20 (halftime 14-13) in a rugby union tour match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>London - Tries: Jeff Alexander, Hamish Rushin. Conversions: Chris Raymond (2). Penalties: Raymond (2).</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Pablo Bouza (3), Tomas Solari (2), Octavio Bartolucci, Ezequiel Jurado, Roberto Travaglini. Conversions: Gonzalo Quesada (7). Penalties: Quesada (3).</p>
